(5471934, 787676, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice plant, we have loads of these in my place too and they smell so nice:)<br/>The colour are a bit muted and blueish and there is a lack of contrast, at least on my monitor. I think it would be better with warmer colours either by setting a different white balance in camera or correcting afterwards. Also, a bit of levels or curve correction would give much more contrast.<br/>The background is a bit too present. Maybe burning and/or blurring it in photoshop would have helped.<br/>Good luck! :)</td>', 'Nice plant, we have loads of these in my place too and they smell so nice:)The colour are a bit muted and blueish and there is a lack of contrast, at least on my monitor. I think it would be better with warmer colours either by setting a different white balance in camera or correcting afterwards. Also, a bit of levels or curve correction would give much more contrast.The background is a bit too present. Maybe burning and/or blurring it in photoshop would have helped.Good luck! :)', '2009-05-06 06:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
