(5471948, 788517, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice composition :)<br/>I personally find both out of focus and saturation in the sky a bit excessive, though.<br/>Once I have seen a shot of a greenhouse lightened up from the inside at dusk, in Copenaghen I think, and it was very effective. If I lived near one of those I would give it a go :)<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Nice composition :)I personally find both out of focus and saturation in the sky a bit excessive, though.Once I have seen a shot of a greenhouse lightened up from the inside at dusk, in Copenaghen I think, and it was very effective. If I lived near one of those I would give it a go :)Good luck!', '2009-05-06 06:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5471963, 788128, 49018, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition :)<br/>Maybe it''s the way I have my monitor calibrated, but the red in horse on the left looks a bit over-saturated. But again, maybe it''s my monitor :)<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Lovely composition :)Maybe it''s the way I have my monitor calibrated, but the red in horse on the left looks a bit over-saturated. But again, maybe it''s my monitor :)Good luck!', '2009-05-06 06:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
