(5472443, 787668, 19670, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but it needs more contrast. If you have Photoshop, here''s a quick way to do that: duplicate your image on another layer, and set the blend mode to soft light. Adjust opacity to your liking. (This challenge was special as it used the Advanced Editing ruleset, so you would be allowed to change the mode from Normal.)</td>', 'Good idea, but it needs more contrast. If you have Photoshop, here''s a quick way to do that: duplicate your image on another layer, and set the blend mode to soft light. Adjust opacity to your liking. (This challenge was special as it used the Advanced Editing ruleset, so you would be allowed to change the mode from Normal.)', '2009-05-06 11:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
