(5473314, 788053, 33352, '<td valign="top">This image has made me stop and take a good look, I like the dappled light effect of the clouds in the reflection,the appearance of the hdr is good,dof is good,But the reflection has distracted from the light effect being busy. I believe if you had taken a line across the top of the bridge and lowered the levels in the top this would have improved the lower half with a better effect, or cropped at the top of the trees raising the 1/3 calibration rather than splitting the photo in half. Of course this is MHO....8 for effort.</td>', 'This image has made me stop and take a good look, I like the dappled light effect of the clouds in the reflection,the appearance of the hdr is good,dof is good,But the reflection has distracted from the light effect being busy. I believe if you had taken a line across the top of the bridge and lowered the levels in the top this would have improved the lower half with a better effect, or cropped at the top of the trees raising the 1/3 calibration rather than splitting the photo in half. Of course this is MHO....8 for effort.', '2009-05-06 18:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5473316, 787205, 53548, '<td valign="top">nice still life. love the textures and shapes here. and ofcourse great tones</td>', 'nice still life. love the textures and shapes here. and ofcourse great tones', '2009-05-06 18:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
