(5474162, 788519, 102925, '<td valign="top">This will probably get a shite overall rating because it''s not cliched or some inside-the-box shot of a pretty thing. But I like it purely because you''ve thought so laterally here and done something different. Nice to see and I''m givin'' ya a nice 8 for your vision here.</td>', 'This will probably get a shite overall rating because it''s not cliched or some inside-the-box shot of a pretty thing. But I like it purely because you''ve thought so laterally here and done something different. Nice to see and I''m givin'' ya a nice 8 for your vision here.', '2009-05-07 03:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
