(5476755, 788715, 11960, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but I am intrinsically drawn to this image. The noise should bother me, but instead I am intrigued. Well done. 10 from me.</td>', 'I don''t know why, but I am intrinsically drawn to this image. The noise should bother me, but instead I am intrigued. Well done. 10 from me.', '2009-05-08 12:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
