(5476852, 788354, 51538, '<td valign="top">What I see out of my window every day.  Not bad exposure.  The bridge vibrates a lot as the cars go by, right?  The bridge lights always turn green when on the tungsten setting.  Odd.  I like the city buildings are nicely exposed for the lighted windows - but what I miss is actually seeing some of the features of the buildings.  I think if the sky was better blue at the magic hour this shot would have been more effective / attractive.</td>', 'What I see out of my window every day.  Not bad exposure.  The bridge vibrates a lot as the cars go by, right?  The bridge lights always turn green when on the tungsten setting.  Odd.  I like the city buildings are nicely exposed for the lighted windows - but what I miss is actually seeing some of the features of the buildings.  I think if the sky was better blue at the magic hour this shot would have been more effective / attractive.', '2009-05-08 13:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
