(5482302, 788715, 106684, '<td valign="top">could not identify anything.</td>', 'could not identify anything.', '2009-05-12 17:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482331, 788395, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice textures and detail, but the composition seems awkward to me. The main subject that my eye is drawn to is lopped off at the top and the rest of the column seem to just be in the way, not leading my eye anywhere. There is also some visible tilt or image skew. Hope that all makes some sense.</td>', 'Nice textures and detail, but the composition seems awkward to me. The main subject that my eye is drawn to is lopped off at the top and the rest of the column seem to just be in the way, not leading my eye anywhere. There is also some visible tilt or image skew. Hope that all makes some sense.', '2009-05-12 17:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482333, 787814, 83313, '<td valign="top">Sweet tones, and I like that fluffy looking tree on the right.</td>', 'Sweet tones, and I like that fluffy looking tree on the right.', '2009-05-12 17:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482335, 787406, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not a flower person, but this is a really effective use of high key.</td>', 'I''m not a flower person, but this is a really effective use of high key.', '2009-05-12 17:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482343, 788659, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what comes in a little short of really grabbing me with this one. Maybe it is the centered composition, or the nearly blown highlights. It may just need some massaging to bring out all that great texture.</td>', 'I''m not sure what comes in a little short of really grabbing me with this one. Maybe it is the centered composition, or the nearly blown highlights. It may just need some massaging to bring out all that great texture.', '2009-05-12 17:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482348, 788363, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not really grabbing me. Maybe it''s a little soft, or too yellowy for my tastes. It''s a hard item to photograph.</td>', 'Not really grabbing me. Maybe it''s a little soft, or too yellowy for my tastes. It''s a hard item to photograph.', '2009-05-12 17:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482351, 788455, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hey, I see some lens flare! <br/> <br/>Just being a twit. This is a case where the flare enhances the shot. You kept the colors subtle instead of cranking them up. Good all around. Except for the fisheye, but that''s just a personal preference thing.</td>', 'Hey, I see some lens flare!  Just being a twit. This is a case where the flare enhances the shot. You kept the colors subtle instead of cranking them up. Good all around. Except for the fisheye, but that''s just a personal preference thing.', '2009-05-12 17:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482352, 788345, 92403, '<td valign="top">wow... that looks awesome!</td>', 'wow... that looks awesome!', '2009-05-12 17:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482354, 788224, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice minimalism. I can just barely make out some texture to the water. That may not even be visible on some monitors.</td>', 'Nice minimalism. I can just barely make out some texture to the water. That may not even be visible on some monitors.', '2009-05-12 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482361, 787965, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. The clouds may be a touch grainy for my taste. Not sure if some selective NR on them would have helped or just made a mess.</td>', 'Nice catch. The clouds may be a touch grainy for my taste. Not sure if some selective NR on them would have helped or just made a mess.', '2009-05-12 17:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482363, 788496, 57447, '<td valign="top">The B&amp;W truly compliments your photo.</td>', 'The B&W truly compliments your photo.', '2009-05-12 17:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482365, 788585, 83313, '<td valign="top">Has the look of a dim, fleeting memory. This is a case where blown highlights actually work with the processing to really make this shot stand out.</td>', 'Has the look of a dim, fleeting memory. This is a case where blown highlights actually work with the processing to really make this shot stand out.', '2009-05-12 17:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482382, 787519, 32033, '<td valign="top">I am not voting on this challenge but this is a GREAT shot.  If you do not win shame on dpchallenge.  Very good detail and the capture is just right on.</td>', 'I am not voting on this challenge but this is a GREAT shot.  If you do not win shame on dpchallenge.  Very good detail and the capture is just right on.', '2009-05-12 18:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482408, 788351, 57202, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and the light on the top of the pews.  The blown out highlights in the window were hard to avoid in getting this shot as a single exposure.  To me, it looks like the type of shot that could benefit from light-handed HDR (slightly desaturated to avoid too much vivid color, which wouldn''t quite match the mood of the shot).  That would allow you to get detail in the room and in the window.  Overall great shot though!</td>', 'I really like the composition and the light on the top of the pews.  The blown out highlights in the window were hard to avoid in getting this shot as a single exposure.  To me, it looks like the type of shot that could benefit from light-handed HDR (slightly desaturated to avoid too much vivid color, which wouldn''t quite match the mood of the shot).  That would allow you to get detail in the room and in the window.  Overall great shot though!', '2009-05-12 18:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5482548, 788216, 102015, '<td valign="top">Very simple and sharp. Great detail!</td>', 'Very simple and sharp. Great detail!', '2009-05-12 20:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
