(5482747, 788585, 11960, '<td valign="top">Bumping from 9 to 10 on a second look through. the light and exposure absolutely make this shot. Feels like kids playing in the streets of a small Italian village. Wowza.</td>', 'Bumping from 9 to 10 on a second look through. the light and exposure absolutely make this shot. Feels like kids playing in the streets of a small Italian village. Wowza.', '2009-05-12 22:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
