(5482753, 787406, 43774, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I like the composition and the negative space. I like that the only colour is at the center of the flowers. Well done, very artistic.</td>', 'I really like this. I like the composition and the negative space. I like that the only colour is at the center of the flowers. Well done, very artistic.', '2009-05-12 22:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
