(5484126, 788770, 53814, '<td valign="top">Beautiful environmental portrait, I''m surprised this didn''t at least get comments from the cat lovers in the crowd. The intense stare and battered whiskers make me think this cat is a hunter and has probably learned to fend for itself. Great capture.</td>', 'Beautiful environmental portrait, I''m surprised this didn''t at least get comments from the cat lovers in the crowd. The intense stare and battered whiskers make me think this cat is a hunter and has probably learned to fend for itself. Great capture.', '2009-05-13 12:42:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5484184, 788519, 95687, '<td valign="top">I think this is cool.</td>', 'I think this is cool.', '2009-05-13 13:16:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5484251, 787610, 79816, '<td valign="top">The lighting has been mentioned before, as has the subject. For a nude to do well here it has to be flawless, as there are a number of users that vote low to anything nude. You''ve also lost the perv vote by using men.<br/> <br/>For me, I think kudos to you for the attempt - try it again with the suggestions Jutilda and JulietNN made. Although you didn''t use a direct flash (from reading your notes) - the lighting does need work. Try to soften out some of those harsh shadows. <br/> <br/>Feel honoured that a couple of people likened it to the work of Michelangelo!<br/> <br/>With models willing to pose like that, you have the potential to produce some great art.<br/> <br/>Even as shot, there is no way this belongs at this end of the results.</td>', 'The lighting has been mentioned before, as has the subject. For a nude to do well here it has to be flawless, as there are a number of users that vote low to anything nude. You''ve also lost the perv vote by using men. For me, I think kudos to you for the attempt - try it again with the suggestions Jutilda and JulietNN made. Although you didn''t use a direct flash (from reading your notes) - the lighting does need work. Try to soften out some of those harsh shadows.  Feel honoured that a couple of people likened it to the work of Michelangelo! With models willing to pose like that, you have the potential to produce some great art. Even as shot, there is no way this belongs at this end of the results.', '2009-05-13 13:34:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5484291, 788764, 95687, '<td valign="top">sorry, honest mistake.  I planned a whole family outing to the island so I could shoot a spectacular sunset for this challenge.  Well this is all I got!  Mother nature wasn''t in the mood this day.<br/> <br/>Sorry about the DQ, guess I''d better check my camera.</td>', 'sorry, honest mistake.  I planned a whole family outing to the island so I could shoot a spectacular sunset for this challenge.  Well this is all I got!  Mother nature wasn''t in the mood this day. Sorry about the DQ, guess I''d better check my camera.', '2009-05-13 13:44:11.000000', NULL, 0),
