(5485327, 788671, 103142, '<td valign="top">Sorry, meant to comment on images before challenge was over, but life got busy.<br/> <br/>I love the idea, but I gave it a 5. <br/> <br/>1. Even good ideas should be relatively appealing. The banana really isn''t good for anything except muffins. It''s kind of gross looking... So I "feel nothing" for the banana--so who cares if it''s abducted? good riddance!<br/> <br/>2. graininess doesn''t really add much.<br/> <br/>3. the thing on the right makes it look like it was a quick shot instead of a planned one.<br/> <br/>4. It''s really not a nice banana. I mean, it doesn''t have to be perfect. A wonderfully, beautiful banana wouldn''t have as much character, but it looks chewed up on the right side and it looks like it''s starting to mold.<br/> <br/>5. stem doesn''t really need to disappear quite so much (nit-picking)<br/> <br/>6. I really don''t like the banana. (or did I say that before...)</td>', 'Sorry, meant to comment on images before challenge was over, but life got busy. I love the idea, but I gave it a 5.  1. Even good ideas should be relatively appealing. The banana really isn''t good for anything except muffins. It''s kind of gross looking... So I "feel nothing" for the banana--so who cares if it''s abducted? good riddance! 2. graininess doesn''t really add much. 3. the thing on the right makes it look like it was a quick shot instead of a planned one. 4. It''s really not a nice banana. I mean, it doesn''t have to be perfect. A wonderfully, beautiful banana wouldn''t have as much character, but it looks chewed up on the right side and it looks like it''s starting to mold. 5. stem doesn''t really need to disappear quite so much (nit-picking) 6. I really don''t like the banana. (or did I say that before...)', '2009-05-13 23:56:46.000000', NULL, 0),
