(5507854, 788670, 48954, '<td valign="top">in my opinion the whole thing could be sharper. the thing that bothers me the most is oversaturation of the eyes and the blurred edges of the subject with the background. It''s a little to "in your face" and obvious. The baby''s left arm in yellow from photoshop manuipulation. You need to go over that spot with a black brush to fix it. Also, on the left side of the image you can see the folds  in the sheet that was use as the background.<br/> <br/>All these things make the image a little unpleasant to look at. It could be better, it just needs some more work :)</td>', 'in my opinion the whole thing could be sharper. the thing that bothers me the most is oversaturation of the eyes and the blurred edges of the subject with the background. It''s a little to "in your face" and obvious. The baby''s left arm in yellow from photoshop manuipulation. You need to go over that spot with a black brush to fix it. Also, on the left side of the image you can see the folds  in the sheet that was use as the background. All these things make the image a little unpleasant to look at. It could be better, it just needs some more work :)', '2009-06-01 06:31:10.000000', NULL, 0),
