(5816022, 788671, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is classic! I''m not surprised at the low score but I think it''s a stroke of genius!<br/> <br/>The fact that the banana is rotten only enhances the strangeness of the shot for me. The perspective is great, very old style sci-fi look. Love it!</td>', 'This is classic! I''m not surprised at the low score but I think it''s a stroke of genius! The fact that the banana is rotten only enhances the strangeness of the shot for me. The perspective is great, very old style sci-fi look. Love it!', '2010-01-17 20:24:24.000000', NULL, 0),
